      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to talk to people when they just respond with \"it gets better\" or generic advice. they dont understand that there is no better. there's just the same cycle. you're saying it's valid to feel that way... but do you actually think there's any logic in staying when everything is just broken?",
